I'm guessing you're working in makeplural(), found in objnam.c?

You're probably banging up against the already existing code for
fungus, homunculus, etc.:

	/* fungus/fungi, homunculus/homunculi, but buses, lotuses, wumpuses
*/
	if (len > 3 && !strcmp(spot-1, "us") &&
	    (len < 5 || (strcmp(spot-4, "lotus") &&
			 (len < 6 || strcmp(spot-5, "wumpus"))))) {
		*(spot--) =3D (char)0;
		*spot =3D 'i';
		goto bottom;
	}

Move your segment above that part.

I also don't think you want your podes to start at spot+3; rather it
should start at spot-2, the
same place that pus is found.


